# What Prettier does not own.
#
# `mix format` owns Elixir and HEEx (`.formatter.exs`); Prettier owns the
# JavaScript and CSS that esbuild and tailwind ship, which the Elixir formatter
# never looks at. Vendored bundles are someone else's formatting, and the
# generated and built trees are not source at all.

node_modules/
vendor/

# Build output: written by esbuild and tailwind, never edited.
../priv/static/

# Lockfiles: npm writes them, Prettier only churns them.
package-lock.json
